1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
Listen to a talk in a history class.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,340
Today we'll examine the Silk Road

3
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:11,210
an ancient network of trade routes that connected the east and west.

4
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:14,476
The Silk Road was not a single road,

5
00:00:14,476 --> 00:00:19,376
but a series of interconnected paths that facilitated the exchange of goods,

6
00:00:19,376 --> 00:00:23,050
ideas and cultures from China to the Mediterranean Sea.

7
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:26,735
Originating in the Han Dynasty around the 2nd century BCE,

8
00:00:26,735 --> 00:00:30,788
the Silk Road was named after the lucrative trade in silk

9
00:00:30,788 --> 00:00:35,210
which was one of the most sought-after commodities in the western world.

10
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:38,290
However, it wasn't just silk that was traded.

11
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:41,880
Merchants carried spices, precious metals

12
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:46,170
textiles and other valuable items across vast distances.

13
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:52,190
The Silk Road also played a critical role in the transmission of knowledge and culture.

14
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:57,268
It enabled the spread of technologies such as paper making and gunpowder,

15
00:00:57,268 --> 00:01:00,230
as well as artistic and religious influences.

16
00:01:00,230 --> 00:01:04,100
For instance, Buddhism spread from India to China

17
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:07,050
and other parts of Asia via the Silk Road.

18
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:12,953
The decline of the Silk Road began in the 15th century with the rise of maritime trade routes

19
00:01:12,953 --> 00:01:14,760
and the fall of the Mongol Empire

20
00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:18,200
which had provided stability and security for the merchants.

21
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:24,130
Although it no longer exists, the legacy of the Silk Road endures,

22
00:01:24,130 --> 00:01:25,780
highlighting the importance of cultural

23
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:30,060
and economic exchanges in shaping human history.
